      "section": "Consumer information and recording methods",
      "statement": "宫颈黏液或分泌物在周期中可能变化；这类日志首先是本人观察。把出现日期与实际月经事件一起保存，跨多次实际记录再看模式。",
      "limitation": "HHS为一般生理背景；单次黏液外观不能确定个人排卵、受孕能力或训练阶段，未记日志不等于没有分泌物或症状。",
      "scope": "Public menstrual-cycle education; observation only, no inferred phase",
      "license": "US-GOVERNMENT-WORK",
      "license_url": "https://www.womenshealth.gov/about-us",
      "parser_version": "reviewed-author-html-3-master-mucus-observation",
