      },
      "statement": "WHO术语表分别定义日常活动的场景和体适能。工作、通勤、休闲的活动机会都会改变记录量；要判断行走能力，还要比较相似任务下实际的速度或功能表现。",
      "limitation": "术语定义适用于区分问题；没有给出个人行走能力下降的诊断界线。",
      "scope": "WHO 2020 physical activity guidelines, glossary, population-neutral definitions",
      "domain": "wearable"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "MASTER-SLEEP-ORDER",
      "source_id": "R4",
      "version_id": "R4:fulltext:89f5d4c3f1608f83a09b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1",
      "hashes": {
        "R4:fulltext:89f5d4c3f1608f83a09b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067": "05cbe4092002c1e9ef67e7dad57d67a5e782a03c03f76cee3bef350fd71b613e",
