      },
      "statement": "这项综述比较了运动前不同的睡眠限制方案，也分析了任务种类与测试时段。核对本人的记录时，先对齐训练前一晚与次日同条件任务，再分别看训练之后的睡眠。",
      "limitation": "来自实验性急性睡眠损失研究。手表记录较短也可能是覆盖不足；不能从实验均值算出个人减量幅度。",
      "scope": "systematic review of controlled acute sleep loss before physical performance; timing and task stratification",
      "domain": "recovery"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "MASTER-DEVICE-CONTEXT",
      "source_id": "V15-FDA-DHT-2023",
      "version_id": "V15-FDA-DHT-2023:fulltext:8beb76ed0d20be27958d:pdf-structure-1.5.1-document-component-scope-1.5.2",
      "hashes": {
        "V15-FDA-DHT-2023:fulltext:8beb76ed0d20be27958d:pdf-structure-1.5.1-document-component-scope-1.5.2:s00186": "79c72994879727b3fb09d58cfd78ae178ffc71d68949a618b6b18b6a99f99f89"
      },
      "statement": "设备记录的解释依赖佩戴、操作、维护和校准方式；同时记录实际症状与正在进行的活动，能帮助解释设备结果。先核对原始记录及设备条件，再比较不同日期。",
      "limitation": "FDA原文面向临床研究中的数字健康工具；这里只采用记录情境原则，不验证某一Watch通知、跌倒探测或症状类别，也不从缺记录推断无异常。",
      "scope": "FDA 2023 digital health technology guidance; general recording context, no device-specific validation",
      "domain": "wearable"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "MASTER-EVENT-RESPONSE",
      "source_id": "V15-FDA-DHT-2023",
      "version_id": "V15-FDA-DHT-2023:fulltext:8beb76ed0d20be27958d:pdf-structure-1.5.1-document-component-scope-1.5.2",
